{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜個人資料外洩(一)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-10-28-13-30-40bpfEJ7DW.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：個人資料外洩</p><p>有航空公司及零售商戶先後發生資料外洩事故，客戶接到懷疑詐騙電話，估計外洩的原因是甚麼？商戶如何提升網絡安全措施，以保障客戶私隱？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>立法會保安事務委員會主席邵家輝</p><p>電腦保安專家賴灼東</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T06:21:18.148503+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:38:22.365463+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T06:18:24.467921+00:00","content_hash":"81351130166292dcfeda560aa504b04832b07b53c53379206bc986804b08d24e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T06:21:18.148503+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}